<p><code>/harness</code> handles a request in six steps in total.</p>
<ol>
    <li><strong>Analyze</strong> the request</li>
    <li><strong>Design</strong> the agent <strong>team</strong></li>
    <li>Create the <strong>agents</strong></li>
    <li>Create the <strong>skills</strong></li>
    <li>Create the <strong>orchestrator</strong> · establish the workflow</li>
    <li><strong>Verify</strong> the harness setup</li>
</ol>

<div class="note">
    <span class="nh">Six team behavior patterns</span>
    Six collaboration patterns for an agent team are specified &mdash; sequential execution, parallel then integrate, a review process, and so on. These patterns are <strong>combined as hybrids</strong> to act as the situation requires.
</div>
